# Materials for the IsoRim models.
# Kd is the colour, map_Kd the texture under the mod's Textures folder (no extension).
# Names starting with "stuff" are also multiplied by the colour of the build material,
# and {stuff} becomes Wood, Stone or Metal to match it.
# Names starting with "leaf" are left out while a tree is bare,
# and names starting with "twig" are only drawn while it is bare.

newmtl stuff
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}

newmtl stuff_dark
Kd 0.800 0.800 0.800
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}

newmtl stuff_deep
Kd 0.620 0.620 0.620
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}

